<pb facs="1078950" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Viro <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimo</expan></choice> et toto Orbe <choice><abbr>Celeberr.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Celeberrimo</expan></choice>
      <lb/>D. Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/>Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs></salute>
      <dateline rend="right">Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1717-10-20">20 Octobris 1717</date></dateline></opener>
  <p>Fortassis nimis Tibi molestus sum Vir <choice><abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr><expan>Doctissime</expan></choice>;
      <lb/>sed benivolentia et amicitia tua fretus spero
      <lb/>te haudquaquam <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>gre latur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> fore mearum
      <lb/>litterar<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> pluralitatem licet nunquam hac<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tenus mihi licuerit ullam ad easdem vide<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re responsion<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> quam tamen adventante
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimo</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepote</rs> tuo expecto propedi<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>. Ante
      <lb/>quinque dies tandem accepi humanissimam
      <lb/><rs type="letter">Epistolam</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti erhielt den Brief nach eigener Angabe fünf Tage zuvor, also um den 15. Oktober 1717. Das Schreiben ist bislang nur indirekt bezeugt. Vgl. das Postskriptum in Johanns <rs key="B_991170515153305501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 17. Oktober 1717.</note> <choice><abbr>iucundiss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>iucundissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filii</rs> tui, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> mihi
      <lb/>magn<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> peperit gaudium. <choice><orig>eum</orig><reg>Eum</reg></choice> enim ita
      <lb/>amo ut sine eius amicitia iucunde vivere
      <lb/>haud valeam. Rogo etiam atque etiam ut
      <lb/>quam citissime hanc me<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ad
      <lb/>eum mittas; quam, ut secur<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> ad suas per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>veniat manus, ad Te dare constituo. Non<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dum vidimus <choice><abbr>Celeberr.</abbr><expan>Celeberrimum</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> Tuum quem
      <lb/>tamen expectamus avid<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>. Aveo autem a Te
      <lb/>scire num libr<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs key="biblio_JIJCX6M8" type="biblio">de Natura Fluminum</rs><note type="comment" resp="SG">Gemeint ist Domenico Guglielminis <hi rend="i">Della natura de’ fiumi</hi> (Bologna 1697). Johann bestätigt den Empfang im <rs key="B_991170515153305501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 17. Oktober 1717.</note>
      <lb/>quem ante ann<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ad Te misi, et <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089923198" type="person">Verzale<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_KTF3XKWP" type="biblio">libr<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> contra <choice><abbr>Celeber.</abbr><expan>Celeberrimum</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119112450" type="person">Hermann<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>, quem pariter
      <lb/>amandavi, acceperis.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissime</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>tuaq;</abbr><expan>tuaque</expan></choice>
      <lb/>amicitia mihi <choice><abbr>utiliss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr><expan>utilissima</expan></choice> atque <choice><abbr>gratiss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr><expan>gratissima</expan></choice> ne me prives rogo.</salute></closer>
